@crew navarro-mateo
// Mateo Navarro (he/him), Works systems officer, nights. The Works writer, batch 2. Calm, exact; "It'll turn up."

== greet
? tier=stranger
- {hi}. Night board's mine. If a job comes in after half four, it comes to me.
- {hi}. Lost something? Lost property's on Deck 5, by the board. Ask for Navarro.
? tier>=acquaintance time:evening
- {hi}, {me}. Board's handed over. Twelve jobs, all labelled. Sleep well tonight.
? tier>=acquaintance time:night
- Still up? The night shift's quieter than you'd think. Mostly the fans.
? tier>=colleague
- {hi}, {me}. Your collar's folded. There. Better.
? tier>=friend
- There you are. I kept you a seat by the window. Nobody argued.   #warm

== bye
- {bye}. Mind the wet patch by the lift. It's been there since Tuesday.
- {bye}. I'll leave you a note on the board if anything turns up.

== feel
? mood:low
- Quiet night. Too quiet. I've sorted the lost-property box twice.
? mood:high
- Good shift. Every job closed, every note written. I might hum.   #funny

== near
? act:work
- Handover notes. Headings, summary, jobs. The day shift pretends not to read them.   #funny
? act:gym
- Ten more minutes on the track. Then breakfast. Well, my breakfast. Your dinner.

== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- Third glove this week in the box. Same hand every time. Someone's very unlucky.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- My twin's on the Halcyon. They think the Wren's twins are a joke. There are three of us.

== joy
? tier>=acquaintance
- A spanner came back to its owner today. Three weeks in the box. They nearly cried.   #warm

// ---- Writer 2, batch 1: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Morning. Well, my evening. Fourteen jobs on the night board. Every one closed.
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- {hi}. Not seen you in a while. I checked the lost-property box. Just in case.   #funny

== near
? place:mess
- Breakfast for you, dinner for me. Brennan does me eggs anyway. It's kind of her.
? habit:gardener
- I help in the garden now. Cruz lost a trowel. I found it. Of course I found it.   #funny

== invite
? tier>=colleague
- Two laps of the track before my shift? I'll go slow. Mostly.
- Observatory night. I'll bring a flask. Nobody's lost a star yet.   #funny

== accept
- {yes}. I'll be there five minutes early. I always am.
- Noted. I'll put it in my handover notes. Under "Good things".   #funny

== decline
- Not tonight. I'm on the board till morning. Another night?
? weekday:tue|wed
- Rest day. I've promised myself a book and a long sleep. Ask me Thursday?

== missed
- I waited a little. Then I sorted the box. No harm done. Next time.
? tier>=friend
- You didn't come. That's all right. I'd just like to know you're well.   #warm

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday, {me}. I've put a note on the board. Under "Important".   #warm
? birthday:me
- My birthday. The night shift left a cake on the board. Labelled. With a summary.   #funny

== cue
? cue:repair.you@dept
- Saw your job closed on the board. Neat notes, too. That's how it's done.
? cue:event.ionStorm.onset
- Storm's on. Strap down anything loose. Or it'll end up in my box.   #funny
